WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:13.260
Y'all already know what it is- it's Thug Notes,
bitches; and this week we gettin' serious

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:19.780
bout da bread with The Merchant of Venice
by William Shakespeare.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:26.099
Noble brutha Bassanio got it BAD fo' a girl
who got as much paper as she got booty- Portia

00:00:26.099 --> 00:00:27.400
of Belmont.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:32.390
Dude wanna put a ring on it, but he blown
all his cheddar and now he ain't got da ends

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:35.739
to get an uptown girl like her to holla back.

00:00:35.739 --> 00:00:41.200
So Bassanio hit up his boy Antonio, a hood
rich merchant from the lock, and be like "Say

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.610
bruh, think you can front me some cash money
so I can get my woo on with this bangin hunny?

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.940
You know I'll hit you back."

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.490
Antonio like "No dice, bruh.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:55.380
I'm cashed out cuz all my bread invested in
some ships that are flowin' in da sea.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:58.570
But look, I'll cover yo' ass if you can find
a lender."

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:04.170
Up in Belmont, Portia straight buggin cuz
her daddy's will say her she gotta marry whichever

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:09.810
dude picks da right chest outta three-one
gold, one silver, and one lead.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.250
Man, what kinda shit is that?

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:16.760
Portia ain't feelin any of dem gumby-lookin
mofos tryna hit it, but then her main homegirl

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.930
Nerissa say "Maybe that legit playa Bassanio
will drop by.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:23.430
He SO fly."

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:29.470
Back in V-town, Bossanio hit up a Jewish moneylender
named Shylock and tell him Antonio gonna guarantee

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:31.000
a loan of 3Gs.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:37.460
Thing is, Shylock got beef with Antonio cuz
Shy-guy don't like da way Antonio do bidness

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:40.020
and always be hatin' on is Jewish roots.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:46.000
So he agree to lend em da cash under one condition:
if Bassanio can't pay up in three months,

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.840
Shylock gonna take a pound of Antonio's FLESH.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.979
Man... that's steep, bruh.

00:01:50.979 --> 00:01:53.340
Antonio say "aight" though.

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:58.630
So Bassanio get dat cash-money and peace out
to Belmont with his boy Gratiano.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:03.560
While Shylock busy plottin', his daughter
Jessica run off and marry Antonio's homie

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.560
Lorenzo.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.560
Damn.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:12.560
In Belmont, Portia drowning in a buncha lame-ass
bustas all jonezin to get a crack at dat ass.

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.030
But first they gotta choose from dem three
chests.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:21.450
The first two scrubs pick the gold and silver,
but EHHHH- dat ain't gonna unlock dem legs.

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:27.620
Then Bassanio drop in to town, roll up to
the scene, and pick da lead chest like a

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.620
boss.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:29.620
DING DING!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.950
THAT'S RIGHT BOY- Portia ALL yours!

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:37.050
So Portia give him a ring and say "You best
not EVER take this thang off."

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:38.330
"Damn, girl.

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:39.330
Aight."

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:44.600
Gratiano say he and Nerissa in love too, so
they suggest a double wedding- cuz go big

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.010
or go home, right?

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:51.540
Just as they bout to pop bottles, they get
word dat Antonio's ships lost at sea, so he

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:53.740
ain't got the money to pay Shylock back.

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:59.840
When Bassanio hear this, he like "Shit I gotta
bust ass home and save mah boy!"

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:04.180
Portia give her boo some fat stacks to pay
off the debt, but she got another plan she

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:05.200
cookin' up.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.550
She and Nerissa gonna dress up as dudes and
swang over to Venice.

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:14.970
Up at court, Bassanio offer Shylock 6 big
ones, TWICE the original loan.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:17.180
But Shylock like "Nah, blood.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.770
I want dat pound of flesh."

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:24.330
The Duke of Venice lookin' fo some advice
on da case, so out comes a legal whiz named

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:28.879
Balthazar but, on the real, it's Portia dressed
up like a dude.

00:03:28.879 --> 00:03:30.650
She still fine though.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:34.940
Girl start talkin bout how Shylock need to
show mercy but he ain't feelin it.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:39.540
So Antonio ready to get carved up real good,
but then Portia like "HOLD UP!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:44.160
Yuh, the law say you can have a pound of his
flesh, but it DON'T say you can draw any of

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.980
his blood, blood.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:49.849
Spill a single drop, and yo' crib and all
yo money belong to the law.

00:03:49.849 --> 00:03:51.840
So good luck with that."

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:55.580
Shylock like "Psssssh FIIIIIINE I'll just
take the cash."

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.470
But Portia say "Nuh-uh.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:58.550
Not so fast playboy.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:04.060
Since you tried to ice a Venetian citizen,
you gotta give up all yo property- half to

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:09.550
the state, half to Antonio, AND the Duke get
to decide whether you live o' die."

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:12.290
The Duke pity da fool and let him walk away.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:17.940
Anotinio say "Aight son, I'll give you yo
cash back on two conditions- 1.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:23.690
You gotta become a Christian and 2- you leave
all yo benjamins to Lorenzo and Jessica after

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.320
you die."

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.480
Shylock like "aight.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.940
Fine" and peaces out.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:34.080
Not knowing Balthazar is really his woman,
Bassanio try to throw her some mad gratitude,

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:37.340
but Portia like "yo playboy I want dat ring."

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:43.430
And Nerissa, disguised as Balthazar's right
hand man, say da same thing to Gratiano.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:48.490
Both boys hand over the bling and head back
to the crib where Portia and Nerissa be chillin.

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:49.490
They like "YO.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:51.430
WHERE DA HELL ARE YO RINGS?"

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:56.960
But Before shit go to far, da girls reveal
dat dem boys just got punked and it's alllllll

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:57.960
good.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:02.370
In da end, Lorenzo all geeked to know dat
after Shylock bite the dust, he and Jessica

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.710
gonna be buried in benjamins.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:09.950
And Antonio get word dat his ships all good,
so his paper still legit.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.400
Phew.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:18.330
My man Willy Shakes is so gangsta that when
he busts a mad lyrical flow- it change the

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.400
way people talk fo' all time.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:25.200
You ever heard somebody say they gonna take
a pound of flesh if they ain't get paid?

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:27.750
Yep, it came from this play right hurr.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:32.190
Or ever heard someone who shady with money
called a shyster?

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:35.070
Yeah, dat come from our boy Shylock.

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:38.930
And well... that's where stuff start gettin
messy.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:43.680
See, this play is one of da most notorious
of all da bad bard's works.

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:44.960
What's the beef?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:50.520
Well open up yo ears and soak this game up:
Most scholars say da main jam of this text

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:55.151
is dat holy rollin with Jesus make yo' thuggin
all righteous, but if you ain't- like say

00:05:55.151 --> 00:05:58.270
you Jewish- then yo' morals are way outta
whack.

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:02.330
Now keep in mind this mess was written back
in the day when this kinda prejudice against

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.920
foreigners was goin down on the reg.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:11.760
Antonio reppin all da virtuous things Christianity
preachin'- like showin mad love to yo neighbor.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:16.930
Antonio's wallet always open to his homies,
he neva' charge any points on top of da principal,

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:21.430
and dude offers up his OWN life just to get
his boys back.

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:26.460
Whereas Shylock s'posed to rep all da crooked
morals you might have when you sippin on the

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.940
manischewitz instead of da Jesus joose.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:34.100
Fo one, shylock only got ONE thing on his
mind- stackin paper off otha' peoples problems.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:40.139
And when homies ask him to show a lil mercy
up at court, he would rather see Antonio bleed

00:06:40.139 --> 00:06:42.139
out n' die like a bitch.

00:06:42.139 --> 00:06:46.949
So was da bard really throwin' shade at Jews
or was he playin a mo' subtle game?

00:06:46.949 --> 00:06:52.710
If you look close, it ain't just Shylock who
actin shady- ERRYBODY got that side- whether

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.820
they Christian, Jewish- whatever.

00:06:54.820 --> 00:07:00.310
Fo example, if Shakespeare really sayin' Christians
are mo' legit towards their fellow man, then

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:04.860
why is Antonio always talkin shit bout Shylock
and callin him a dog?

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:09.110
Cuz on the real, Shylock ain't da only one
on dat vengeance grind.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:13.660
Antonio sho as hell don't turn the other cheek
when he make Shylock convert and tell him

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.920
how he s'posed to spend his money.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:20.569
No matter what faith you representin, you
might wanna dole out a lil' payback.

00:07:20.569 --> 00:07:24.430
Like Shylock say: "If a Jew wrong a Christian,
what is his humility?

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:25.430
Revenge.

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:29.030
If a Christian wrong a Jew, what should his
sufferance be by Christian example?

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:30.030
Why, revenge."

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.030
(III.i.64-67)

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.970
And how about dat boy Bassanio?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:37.850
Errybody always runnin they mouths bout Shylock
being obsessed with da bread, but why do Bassanio

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.050
got it bad for Portia?

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:41.550
CUZ SHE RICH.

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:45.260
As he say "In Belmont is a lady richly left."

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:46.910
Portia ain't no saint neither.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:53.300
Girl don't wanna marry da prince of Morocco
just cuz of da color of his skin: "If I could

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:58.330
bid the fifth welcome with so good heart as
I can bid the other four farewell, I should

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:03.630
be glad of his approach: if he have the condition
of a saint and the complexion of a devil,

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.900
I had rather he should shrive me than wive
me."

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:08.979
That's some bulllllshit!

00:08:08.979 --> 00:08:10.460
But it don't stop there.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:16.259
Yuh, Antonio a pretty generous brutha, willing
to sacrifice himself for his homie n' shit,

00:08:16.259 --> 00:08:18.500
but he never SHUT DA HELL UP ABOUT IT.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:21.919
It's like he tryna get people to talk bout
him like he freakin Jesus.

00:08:21.919 --> 00:08:27.690
"I am a tainted wether of the flock,/ Meetest
for death: the weakest kind of fruit/ Drops

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:33.079
earliest to the ground, and so let me;/ You
cannot better be employ'd, Bassanio,/ Than

00:08:33.079 --> 00:08:35.260
to live still and write mine epitaph."

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.550
Is he really as selfless as he say?

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:39.800
Or do he just have a big-ass head?

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:44.070
So look- there ain't no doubt this play got
the stank of more prejudiced times all up

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:45.070
on it.

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:49.009
But was Ol' Willy really sayin dat religion
define da way you treat anotha' brotha?

00:08:49.009 --> 00:08:54.509
Or did he pull a fast one by subtly callin
out all dem Elizabethans on their bullshit?

00:08:54.509 --> 00:09:00.200
Either way, yo boy Sparky know that ANYONE
can have a serious hater streak to em- no

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.560
matter what religion they representin'.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:03.840
Yo thanks for chillin' wit yo boy.

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:06.340
Keep it real up in the library y'all.

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:07.060
Peace!

